  'Move {0} and its whole roster from {1} to {2}? Its inventory, sales, intake, coffers, discounts, and notices go with it. Completed transfers stay behind as history in the source realm.': '¿Mover {0} y toda su plantilla de {1} a {2}? Su inventario, ventas, entradas, arcas, descuentos y avisos van con ella. Los traspasos completados se quedan como historial en el reino de origen.',
  'Move {0} from {1} to {2}? They keep their shop only if one of the same name exists there; otherwise they arrive with no shop assigned.': '¿Mover a {0} de {1} a {2}? Solo conserva su tienda si existe una con el mismo nombre allí; si no, llega sin tienda asignada.',
